  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding to support more humanitarian contexts with call data record derived population insights. Which will refine and improve methodologies and technology tools, undertake research to understand and mitigate bias, establish additional relationships with telecommunication companies in advance of a crisis and integrate analysis into existing humanitarian coordination processes.</narrative>
